  "details": "I’ve come across multiple people Using harmful mods, such as removing all colliders (making you fall through the world endlessly forcing you to restart vrc) crashers (of course) and mods that allow you to rip avatars (Which people have been ripping mine) and ones that ruin the game for other people, now you can report them, but you can’t report them for having a mod, Only behaviour and etc, which mods aren’t allowed, but I don’t know how they detect when people have mods, that’s beyond my knowledge, but it would be nice to be able to report people for having mods which can ruin the experience for others, like people ruining a udon game or vrc it self. I hope others Agree with me and this can make it somewhere. \nThank you.\nDoodle",
